  <title>Job sheet history</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Job sheet history</gui></guiseq> lists
  every <link xref="job_sheet">job sheet</link>, with its customer, date, job
  and description. Type into the search boxes to find one by customer, ext.
  name, job or description. Double click a job to see the products used on it.
  <gui>Refresh</gui> reloads the list.</p>

